    <briefdescription>
<para>Indicates that periodic advertising synchronization was lost or a synchronization establishment procedure was canceled. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The synchronization establishment procedure can be canceled explicitly by the application by issuing command <ref refid="group__sl__bt__sync_1ga628b8ea37bf3347475eb01b0971981aa" kindref="member">sl_bt_sync_close</ref>, or internally due to synchronization failing. Synchronization can fail for example due to incompatible sync CTE type. </para>
